ult":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-10-13T05:41:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T20:57:55Z","closed_at":"2026-10-19T20:57:31Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124423","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124423","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124423.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124423.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-19T20:57:31Z"},"body":"# Summary\n\nIn the 2D editor, dragging a resource from the FileSystem dock onto the viewport, or using \"Add Node Here\" / \"Instantiate Scene Here\" from the viewport context menu, creates the node at the wrong position when the selected parent is a `SubViewport` under a `SubViewportContainer`. The drop preview shows the correct spot, but the node is created elsewhere. With `stretch_shrink = 4` the node lands 4x too far from the viewport origin, plus the container's offset.\n\nThe same happens when the parent is a `CanvasItem` inside a `CanvasLayer` with a non-identity transform: the layer offset and scale are ignored.\n\n`CanvasItemEditor::add_node_to_scene` and `CanvasItemEditorViewport::_create_instance` convert the drop position into the parent's local space with `get_global_transform()` / `get_global_transform_with_canvas()`. Those return transforms relative to the parent's own viewport, not the edited scene's canvas. For a `SubViewport` parent no conversion is done at all, so the node keeps edited-scene canvas coordinates. The editor draws selection boxes with `get_screen_transform()`, which does include the container and `stretch_shrink` scale, so the preview is right and the result is wrong.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. New 2D scene, root `Node2D`.\n2. Add `SubViewportContainer`, set `stretch = true`, `stretch_shrink = 4`, size 1280x800.\n3. Add `SubViewport` child. It becomes 320x200.\n4. Select `SubViewport` in the Scene dock.\n5. Drag `icon.svg` from the FileSystem dock onto the 2D viewport, near the center of the container.\n\nExpected: `Sprite2D` created under the cursor, position around (160, 100).\nActual: `Sprite2D` created at around (640, 400), outside the viewport.\n\n### Examples\n\n| comment | before | after |\n| :---- | :---- | :---- |\n| Drag icon onto SubViewport | <img alt=\"CleanShot 2026-10-13 at 16 31 42\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/917b1d7a-f26e-48ec-b1ba-83c9e3281c84\" /> | <img alt=\"CleanShot 2026-10-13 at 16 38 04\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a7c209da-12a4-468c-bd00-7d7866ec34b6\" /> |\n| Add 2D Node here onto SubViewport | <img alt=\"CleanShot 2026-10-13 at 16 33 18\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/48bb23b2-14ac-4bcf-a150-1d5f7e57efe4\" /> | <img alt=\"CleanShot 2026-10-13 at 16 39 41\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d7d6bb04-990d-4c89-be04-0e965bc1aba1\" /> |\n| Drag icon onto CanvasLayer | <img alt=\"CleanShot 2026-10-13 at 16 34 53\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2fee1a95-79db-4c2a-8c8d-b813700ab665\" /> | <img alt=\"CleanShot 2026-10-13 at 16 40 49\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64cdb282-8a53-413c-bed2-55d96fe3d9f3\" /> |\n| Add 2D Node here onto CanvasLayer | <img alt=\"CleanShot 2026-10-13 at 16 36 11\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c624c51-4d8d-459f-b694-4e36943cb50f\" /> | <img alt=\"CleanShot 2026-10-13 at 16 41 24\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cdbee0d1-a5da-4993-a10c-b5ec25fcd516\" /> |\n\n\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124423/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124423/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}